  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the tandoor to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large pot, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onions and cook until they are translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the diced foie gras and cook until it is seared on all sides.",
    "Add the chickpeas, lentils, diced tomatoes, vegetable broth, salt, black pepper, and smoked paprika to the pot.",
    "Stir well and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer the harira for 20 minutes.",
    "Serve the harira hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired.",
    "Drizzle with olive oil and serve immediately."
  ],
